 "site_label_correction": {
  "finding": "The task named `0x2c37f2` as reading `EvpSm4Key.stream_ecb`. The image reads displacement 0x0 of the cipher-data block (`call *(%r12)` with `%r12 = ctx->cipher_data`), which is `block`; `stream_ecb` is at 0x88 and its `if let Some` dispatch is the adjacent unresolved site 0x2c37af.",
  "evidence": "sm4_ecb_cipher disassembly: 0x2c378a/0x2c37c7 `mov 0x78(%rdi),%r12`; 0x2c37ed `lea 0x8(%r12),%rdx`; 0x2c37f2 `call *(%r12)`.  The store at 0x2c34ea also targets displacement 0 and holds sm4_encrypt_block/sm4_decrypt_block.",
  "consequence": "The site is closed against the field it actually reads; 0x2c37af (stream_ecb) remains target-bounded and is not counted in this batch.",
  "adjacent_site": "withdrawn: 0x2c37af appears in neither closure and stream_ecb is only ever stored None; the field correction is unaffected"
 },
